{
  "caveats": [
    "These historical survey results end in 2019 and cannot describe current household incomes. Income is a mean per household, not a median, per-person income or inflation-adjusted amount. Gini uses a 0–1 scale and cannot be added across sectors. Coverage changes prevent treating the early rounds as an unchanged national series. Survey periods and sector definitions must be retained.",
    "The source uses .. for unavailable figures and a dash for nil or negligible. Both retain their printed token and a distinct status; neither is converted to an exact zero."
